    "title": "Trustworthy analytics and feature-health signals",
    "intro": "Today's nightly focuses on making Aura's telemetry and health dashboards honest. The status system now separates what a feature does from where it was exercised, analytics tracking is enforced end-to-end across web, desktop, and mobile builds, and dirty release builds can no longer slip through the deploy gate.",
    "entries": [
