        "title": "Analytics contract enforced across web, desktop, and mobile",
        "summary": "A ground-up rebuild of the analytics pipeline closes the gaps that were producing inaccurate DAU and retention, backed by a new CI contract that fails loudly the moment tracking would silently break.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Server is now the single emitter for session_active, with a typed event registry and AST/pipeline/server contract tests guarding against renamed, dropped, or non-literal event names.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "57b077e8e3596117c08ce0ae032de9bd8e60386c"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "New Analytics Contract workflow runs on every push to main and on PRs touching interface or server analytics code, gating both client registry tests and server Mixpanel tests.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "57b077e8e3596117c08ce0ae032de9bd8e60386c"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "iOS and Android release lanes now bake VITE_MIXPANEL_TOKEN into the store bundle and require analytics validation, so TestFlight and Play Store builds can no longer ship a no-op browser SDK.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "57b077e8e3596117c08ce0ae032de9bd8e60386c"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "text": "Mobile chat input now emits tracking events and the desktop local-server token path was corrected, closing two known reporting holes.",
            "commit_shas": [
              "57b077e8e3596117c08ce0ae032de9bd8e60386c"
            ],
            "confidence": "medium"
          }
        ]
      },
